  "notes": "Everything is gated by the enable flag (default false), so alarms and dashboard are checked via __declared__. The SNS AlarmActions wiring is not expressible: under an empty default a conditional AlarmActions resolves to absent or empty in candidates, and to [\"\"] in the GT, so only the optional ARN parameter is checked. Thresholds in the GT are in ms; accepted in seconds too. PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says the region should default to us-east-1, but the GT has no region parameter and uses ${AWS::Region}; the adapter renders that as us-east-1, which would make any dashboard check vacuous, so no region check is written."
